  "accessories-6": { brand: "", full: "<ul><li>The capacity of LiFePO4 battery is bigger than lead- acid cell, with the same volume; it is double of Lead-acid battery.</li></ul><ul><li>LiFePO4 is light. The weight is just 1/3 of lead-acid cell with the same capacity.</li></ul><ul><li>LiFePO4 battery can discharge with maximum current; it is used in electric vehicles and electric bicycles.</li></ul><ul><li>No matter the LiFePO4 Battery is in which conditions, it can be charged and discharged whenever you like, no need to discharge totally then charge for it.</li></ul><ul><li>The durability of LiFePO4 Battery is powerful and consumption is slow. The time of charging and discharging is more than 2000times. After 2000times circulation, the capacity of the battery is still more than 80%.</li></ul><ul><li>LiFePO4 battery passed the strict safety testing, with higher safety performance.</li></ul><ul><li>The connection tech of all interface, be safe and durable, with simple maintenance.</li></ul><ul><li>Multi-layer protection structure, shockproof, anti explosion and fire.</li></ul><ul><li>Safe and durable for long run.</li></ul><ul><li>Best choice of solar energy storage battery.</li></ul>" }, // 15KWH 48V EXULTED LITHIUM ION BATTERY
