  "3g-and-2g-lte-1": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product description</p><p></p><p>This is an outdoor antenna with wide band frequency designed to work 3G/4G routers from Spectranet,Swift Network,Glo,MTN,Etisalat,Airtel to help increase signal reception.</p><p></p><p>Standardized Process Features</p><p></p><p>YP-3300/3800-2*15D-35/30,Multi band dome antenna is an outdoor directional MIMO antenna that can receive and send signals from a 35° radios. Range of antenna is dependent on three factors:</p><p></p><p>1)physical obstructions,</p><p></p><p>2)power generated by booster/amplifier,</p><p></p><p>3)reception from outside signal received and distributed by outside antenna. Besides the antenna itself,parts include equipment for mounting on the pole.</p><p></p><p>Electrical Specifications Mechanical Specifications</p><p>Frequency Range–MHz 3300-3800MHz Antenna Cover ABS</p><p>Gain-dBi 2*15DBI Cable 2*1M RG58 cable</p><p>Horizontal Beam width -° 35° Connector Type 2*SMA male</p><p>Vertical Beam width -° 30° Color Black</p><p>F/B ratio-dB 17 Operating Temperature -40℃~+65℃</p><p>VSWR ≤1.5 Size 195*175*42mm</p><p>Input Impedance -Ω 50</p><p>Pole Diameter</p><p></p><p>Φ35~55mm</p><p>Polarization ±45 Rated Wind Velocity 210km/h</p><p>Maximum Power -W 20 Unit Package 30*24*12cm;1.6KG</p><p>Lightning Protection DC Ground Carton Package /</p><p>The Panel antenna is compatible with the following products:Booster compatibility: all 5G home and in-building boosters series,and all industrial boosters series.</p><p></p><p>Cable compatibility: Low coax cables with N male on either end.</p><p></p><p>Accessory compatibility: Couplers and splitters.</p><p></p><p>a). Multi band(3400-3800MHz)Broadband</p><p></p><p>b). 5G high speed systems</p><p></p><p>c). Directional antenna broadcasts signal in all directions</p><p></p><p>d). 2*15dB gain</p><p></p><p>e). Designed for outdoor use only pole mounted ,easy to install</p>" }, // 3G/4G Outdoor Antenna for Swift, Spectranet, GSM Networks Dual Cable
  "card-reader-0": { brand: "", full: "<p>This is an outdoor antenna with wide band frequency designed to work 3G/4G routers from Spectranet,Swift Network,Glo,MTN,Etisalat,Airtel to help increase signal reception.</p><p></p><div><div><div><div><div id=\"product-attribute-specs\"><div>Product Information</div><div><div>Brand: Universal Chef</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>" }, // 3G/4G Outdoor Antenna for Swift,Spectranet,GSM Networks
  "cctv-camera-0": { brand: "", full: "<p>3K Smart Hybrid Light Audio Indoor Fixed Turret Camera: Superior Indoor Surveillance with Advanced Audio &amp; Lighting</p><p>The 3K Smart Hybrid Light Audio Indoor Fixed Turret Camera provides unparalleled indoor surveillance with 3K resolution, intelligent lighting, and enhanced audio monitoring. Designed for environments requiring high-quality video and audio, this turret camera ensures optimal indoor security with smart hybrid lighting that adapts to changing conditions.</p><p>Key Features:</p><p>3K Ultra HD Video: Capture crisp and detailed footage with 3K resolution, offering enhanced clarity for better identification and monitoring.<br/> Smart Hybrid Light Technology: Automatically transitions between infrared and white light based on ambient conditions, ensuring clear video in low-light or no-light scenarios.<br/> Integrated Audio: Built-in microphone for real-time audio monitoring, adding an extra layer of security alongside video surveillance.<br/> Fixed Turret Design: Compact and durable, this fixed turret camera blends seamlessly into any indoor setting while providing robust surveillance performance.<br/> Easy Installation: Quick and hassle-free setup with flexible mounting options for various indoor locations.<br/> Applications: Ideal for office spaces, retail environments, residential properties, and indoor commercial areas, the 3K Smart Hybrid Light Audio Indoor Fixed Turret Camera provides high-quality, intelligent security.</p><p>Benefits:</p><p>Ultra HD Clarity: 3K resolution ensures crisp and detailed video, perfect for identifying faces, objects, and events with precision.<br/> Adaptive Lighting: Hybrid lighting adjusts automatically, ensuring the best visibility regardless of the light conditions.<br/> Audio Surveillance: Integrated microphone captures essential audio details, enhancing overall security monitoring.<br/> Compact &amp; Discreet: The fixed turret design ensures a low-profile, unobtrusive installation in any indoor environment.<br/> Enhance your indoor security with the 3K Smart Hybrid Light Audio Indoor Fixed Turret Camera—a top-tier solution combining ultra-clear video, adaptive lighting, and audio monitoring for complete peace of mind.</p><p>SKU: DS-2CE76K0T-LPFS Categories: Hikvision Cameras, Security Cameras Tags: 3K resolution camera, 3K turret camera, audio monitoring camera, audio surveillance camera, built-in microphone camera, compact security camera, easy installation camera., fixed turret camera, HD turret camera, high-definition indoor camera, hybrid light technology, indoor security camera, indoor surveillance, infrared and white light camera, Smart Hybrid Light Camera, smart lighting camera, ultra HD camera</p>" }, // 3K Smart Hybrid Light Audio Indoor Fixed Turret Camera (DS-2CE76K0T-LPFS)
  "cctv-camera-1": { brand: "", full: "<p>This is a complete CCTV kit for home/office and factory surveillance.You can view all on your phone from anywhere you are in the whole world. This kit contains all you need to setup your CCTV. This is a do it yourself kit.If you can install a TV antenna then you can install this.The 4 Channel DVR CCTV kit is perfect for small businesses and offices. It consists of 4 indoor cameras with a dvr machine for full surveillance of your business /home locations.</p><p></p><p>Content</p><p></p><p>One unit of 4 channels DVR</p><p>Four cameras with 4 indoor cameras</p><p>Four 20 meters video and power cable</p><p>500GB storage for like 3</p><p>12V Power adapter for 4 cameras</p>" }, // 4-Channels CCTV KIT – Do It Yourself
  "cctv-camera-2": { brand: "", full: "<p>Do you want to watch/monitor your home or office or factory RIGHT ON YOUR PHONE from ANYWHERE you are in the whole wide world? Here is the SOLUTION.</p><p></p><p>This is a complete CCTV kit for home/office and factory surveillance. You can view all on your phone from anywhere you are in the whole world. This kit contains all you need to setup your CCTV. The 4 Channel DVR CCTV kit is perfect for small businesses and offices. It consists of 4 indoor cameras with a dvr machine for full surveillance of your business /home locations.</p><p></p><p>Content</p><p></p><p>One unit of 4 channels DVR</p><p>Four cameras with 4 indoor cameras</p><p>Four 20 meters video and power cable</p><p>500GB storage.</p><p>12V Power adapter for 4 cameras</p><p>Installation</p>" }, // 4-Channels CCTV KIT + Site Installation
