  "3g-and-2g-lte-2": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product description</p><p>This router is ideal for critical operations where downtime cannot be tolerated. Its therefore used in ATM applications for banks,vending machines, video streaming for churches etc.</p><p></p><p>Category: 4G LTE Devices Tag: 4g dual sim industrial</p><p></p><p>Specifications</p><p></p><p>Weight 1.5 kg</p><p>Product Specification</p><p></p><p>Item Content</p><p>Interface 1*Ethernet, 4* WAN, 1 RS232(or RS485/RS422) 2* SIM/UIM</p><p>Power Range DC 5~36V</p><p>Standard Power DC 12V/1.5A</p><p>Housing Iron, providing IP30 protection</p><p>Dimensions 207×135×28 mm</p><p>Weight 790g</p><p>Operating Temperature (-35°C t~ +75°C) / (-31°F ~ +167°F)</p><p>Warranty 1 year</p><p>Accessories Power Adapter, RS232 serial cable, Cellular Antenna,Wifi Antenna</p><p></p>" }, // 4G Dual SIM Industrial Grade Router with IPSec with Auto Failover
  "3g-and-2g-lte-3": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product details</p><p>This router is made by world class telecomms equipment manufacturer,ZTE so the issue of quality is out of question.</p><p></p><p>This is a universal 4G LTE router that works with ALL,I repeat ALL networks in Nigeria.</p><p>This router works on auto connection, no complicated setup.Simply insert your SIM card and you are good to go.</p><p>32 wireless computers,phones can connect same time.</p><p>4 LAN ports for CCTV,destop PC etc</p><p>2 telephone ports to make calls with SAME data SIM card, this is double funtion.</p><p>1 year no story warranty so what are you waiting for.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>Category: 4G LTE Devices</p>" }, // 4G LTE UNIVERSAL ROUTER BY ZTE
