  "3g-and-2g-lte-7": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product description</p><p></p><p>This is a super high speed 4G LTE router with backward compatibility. This is the best universal router in the market as at now. No other beats this in performance, speed, stability and universality. The 4 solid antennas gives very good reception. Works with NTEL, MTN, Smile, Glo,Airtel,9mobile.Swift,Spectranet or any network with bands B1/B3/B7/B20/B40.</p><p></p><p>16 hours battery backup for you to work from 9am-5pm till closing.</p><p>Confirmed 100% working with MTN,GLO,Airtel,9mobile,Smile,Spectranet,Swift,NTEL.</p><p>1 LAN port for wired LAN connection and CCTV and other devices.</p><p>Comes with 2 solid antennas for super strong signal reception.</p><p>Automatic connection. No configuration needed. Plug and play.</p><p>Works with 4G,3G and even 2G</p><p>32 wireless user.</p><p>300Mbps wireless router system.</p><p>4G LTE Cat 4 FDD/TDD wireless router with RJ45</p><p>Type:4G LTE WIFI CPE Router</p><p></p><p>MTK Chipset : MT6735</p><p></p><p>Frequency Band: FDD operating band B1,B3,B7,B8,B5,B20,B40</p><p>WCDMA:B1,(B5,B8 optional)</p><p>FDD/TDD: Up to 150Mbps DL; Up to 50Mbps UL</p><p>WCDMA: HSDPA up to 42.2Mbps DL; HSUPA up to 11.5Mbps UL</p><p>Wi-Fi Chipset:MT6625L</p><p>Wi-Fi: IEEE 802.11b/g/n</p><p>WiFi Transfer rate: up to 300Mbps</p><p>Encryption: Wi-Fi Protected Access™ (WPA/WPA2)2 WIFI type :2.4G</p><p>Antenna:2.4G External antenna *2, Main LTE antenna*2</p><p>Battery : More than 16 Hours battery backup.</p><p></p><p></p><p>Category: 4G LTE Devices Tags: 4g, data, internet, lte, UNIVERSAL</p><p></p><p>Specifications</p><p>Battery Option</p><p>With 16Hours Battery, Without Battery Backup</p><p></p>" }, // 4G LTE Universal Router (With 8-16Hours Backup)
  "cctv-camera-3": { brand: "", full: "<p>This is the hassles free, wires free, electricity free solar camera ideal for homes,offices, factories, farms etc.</p><p>4G LTE cellular security camera is completely wireless and doesn’t Need Wi-Fi, making it perfect for off-grid or outdoor areas without Wi-Fi. It works wherever there’s 4G coverage, including rural homes, Farm, pasture and construction sites.</p>" }, // 4G Solar Camera with PTZ with Battery Backup
  "antivirus-1": { brand: "", full: "<p>Insert your SIM card into this camera and view your construction site works real time anywhere you are around the globe.</p><p></p><p>Standaone with wifi or no wifi and electrical power needed. It can be worked anywhere nationwide with 4G LTE coverage. 100% wire-free, ideal for outdoor places that is off-grid or no Wi-Fi, such as farms, construction sites, vacations homes, warehouse, etc. Requires Monthly Data Plan for 4G</p><p></p><p>4G Solar Camera with SIM card.</p><p></p><p>Categories: Safety and Security, Security Gadgets Tags: 4g, 4g camera, 4g camera with battery backup, 4g cctv camera, 4g dual sim industrial, 4g security camera, 4g solar camera, 4g solar security camera, 4g solr camera ptz, auto tracking 4g cctv, solar camera with sim card</p>" }, // 4G Solar Camera with SIM-PTZ Security with Battery
  "3g-and-2g-lte-8": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product details</p><p></p><p>This is a universal router that works with ALL networks in Nigeria including Glo that uses band 28 in some locations. Simply insert your sim and start blasting Internet at a dangerous speed.</p><p></p><p>The browsing speed is amazing! And with a backup battery of about 8hours or u have nothing to worry about.</p><p></p><p>Simply put in ANY SIM card from MTN to Glo to Swift or whatever network in Nigeria and you are good to go.</p><p></p><p>Technical Details</p><p></p><p>Max. LAN Data Rate: 300Mbps</p><p></p><p>With Modem Function: NO</p><p></p><p>Standards And Protocols: Wi-Fi 802.11g, Wi-Fi 802.11b, Wi-Fi 802.11n</p><p></p><p>Wi-Fi Supported Frequency: 2.4G</p><p></p><p>Supports WDS: No</p><p></p><p>Supports WPS: No</p><p></p><p>Wi-Fi Transmission Standard: 802.11b</p><p></p><p>Wired Transfer Rate: 150 Mbps</p><p></p><p>2.4G Wi-Fi Transmission Rate: 300 Mbps</p><p></p><p>Encryption Type: WPA2-PSK, WPA-PSK</p><p></p><p>Products Status: New</p><p></p><p>WirelessFunction: FireWall, QoS</p><p></p><p>LAN Ports: 1</p><p></p><p>Brand Name: Signalinks</p><p></p><p>Place of Origin: China</p><p></p><p>Wireless Speed: 300Mbsps</p><p></p><p>Type: 4G LTE CAT 4</p><p></p><p>Wifi mimo: mimo 2×2</p><p></p><p>Indicator/display: LED</p><p></p><p>LTE RF CHIPSET: ZX234220A1</p><p></p><p>Quality Certification: CE,ROHS,CCC etc</p><p></p><p>warranty: 12 Months</p><p></p><p>WiFi sharing: 32 users</p><p></p><p>Category: 4G LTE Devices Tag: #wifi #mtn #glo #etisalat #airtel data #mtn data #</p>" }, // 4G Universal Router with 8Hours Battery
