  "computer-accessories-12": { brand: "", full: "<div><div><h4></h4><p>Introducing the Airtel 4G LTE Mifi Model ZLT M30 pro. The Airtel mifi delivers lightning-fast 4G LTE internet browsing and download speeds of up to 150Mbps. Whether you’re at home, in the office, or on the go, this modem hotspot ensures you stay connected seamlessly.<br/> Experience the power of this device with its exceptional compatibility. It works flawlessly with Ntel 4G, Airtel 4G &amp; 3G, Glo 4G &amp; 3G, 9mobile 4G &amp; 3G, MTNng 4G &amp; 3G, and Smile 4G networks in Nigeria, providing you with unparalleled connectivity options.<br/><b><br/></b><b>Please note that </b>it does not support Spectranet and Swift networks.</p><p>When you register the Airtel SIM card that comes with the device, you’ll receive a fantastic bonus of 5 GB data.<br/> This battery-operated 4G hotspot LTE router is designed to meet your needs. With its LAN and Wi-Fi support, you can effortlessly connect multiple devices and enjoy uninterrupted internet access. The modem hotspot also boasts a long-lasting 2600mAh battery capacity, providing up to 8 hours of usage.</p><p><b>Key Specifications:</b></p><ul><li>– Battery Capacity: 3000mAh (lasts up to 8 hours)</li><li>– Superfast browsing speed of up to 150Mbps</li><li>– Maximum connection with 8 users</li><li>– Ethernet Port: 1 LAN Port with 2 times the speed</li><li>– Dual power options: Battery and USB power</li><li>– Wi-Fi support for 2.4GHz frequency</li><li>– RJ45 port for LAN/WAN</li><li>– WIFI MIMO 2*2</li><li>– Network support for 4G/3G/2G</li><li>– Dual SSID (optional)</li><li>– Aftersales support</li></ul><p><b>What’s in the box</b></p><ul><li>– 1 Airtel 4G LTE Mifi</li><li>– 1 USB cable</li><li>– 1 User Manual</li><li>– 1 Battery</li><li>– 1 Airtel SIM card</li></ul><p><b>Please Note:</b></p><p></p><ul><li>Please ensure to register the SIM card that comes with the mifi device using your National Identification Number (NIN) at any Airtel SIM card registration centre if you plan to use the Airtel SIM card inside.</li></ul><p>Stay connected with the Airtel 4G LTE Mifi Model ZLT M30 pro and enjoy blazing-fast internet speeds wherever you go. Order yours today!</p></div></div><section><div id=\"specifications\"></div><header><h2>Specifications</h2></header><div><article><div><h2>KEY FEATURES</h2><div><ul><li><b>Supports All Network</b></li><li>Connects up to 8 devices at once</li><li>Superfast browsing Speed of up To 150 Mbps</li><li>Network support   4G/ 3G / 2G /</li><li>LTE Cat 4 High Speed Download</li><li>Able to connect with any Wi-Fi enabled device</li><li>Long Lasting 3000mAh battery (For up to 8 hours battery duration).</li><li>Supports Wi-Fi 2.4GHz</li></ul></div></div></article><article><div><h2>WHAT’S IN THE BOX</h2><div><ol><li>1 4G mifi/wifi</li><li>1 3000mAh battery</li><li>1 USB cord for charging</li><li>1 device manual</li><li>1 Airtel sim card</li></ol></div></div></article><article><div><h2>SPECIFICATIONS</h2><ul><li><span>SKU</span>: AI290EA43GVTANAFAMZ</li><li><span>Product Line</span>: Cool Gargets Store</li><li><span>Model</span>: ZLT M30 pro</li><li><span>Weight (kg)</span>: 0.1</li><li><span>Color</span>: White</li><li><span>Main Material</span>: Plastic</li><li><span>Shop Type</span>: Jumia Mall</li></ul></div></article></div></section>" }, // Airtel 4G LTE Universal Mobile MiFi WiFi Internet HotSpot Plus Lan Port & Data Bonus
