  "digital-multimeter-2": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product details<br/> 1. This mini digital instrument performs measurements of AC/DC voltage, AC current, resistance, sound continuity, diode, temperature</p><p>and non-contact ACV (NCV) detection as well as capacitance, Hz, etc.</p><p>2. This is an auto ranging digital multimeter with AC ammeter function.</p><p>3. Multifunctional measuring clamp: can be used to measure AC current, AC/DC voltage, resistance, capacitance, frequency, diode, buzzer, undervoltage detection.</p><p>4. High Accuracy Clamp Multimeter: Intelligent auto clamp multimeter can measure current without continuous line.</p><p>5. Bright Backlit Display for Clear Reading: Bright high-definition display with switchable on/off backlight to display data clearly.</p><p>6. Data Retention: Retain measurement data and easily review or write down the data.</p><p>7. High Reliability and High Efficiency: The LED buzzer alarm has good reliability and high accuracy, which is really convenient for electrical equipment detection and maintenance.</p><p>8. 9.7mm Jaw Opening: 7mm jaw opening allows current to be measured without touching or interrupting the circuit.</p><p>9. Auto Power Off: Powered by 2 x 1.5V AA batteries (not included), the clamp meter will automatically power off after 15 minutes of inactivity.</p><p>Specifications:</p><p>Material: ABS</p><p>Range: auto range</p><p>maximum. Display: 4000 dots</p><p>AC Voltage: 0~600V</p><p>DC Voltage: 0~600V</p><p>Alternating Current: 0~400A</p><p>Capacitance: 0~4mF</p><p>Resistance: 0~40MΩ</p><p>Frequency: 0~400Hz</p><p>Battery: 2 AAA 1.5V batteries (not included)</p><p>Product size: 140*38*11mm/5.51*1.50*0.43in</p><p>Item Weight: 124g / 4.37oz</p><p>Package Weight: 238g / 8.40oz</p><p>Package size: 22*9.2*4cm/8.66*3.62*1.57in</p><p>Package Included:</p><p>1 * clamp meter</p><p>1 * pair of test leads</p><p>1 * manual (English)</p><p>Specifications<br/> Key Features<br/> Material: ABS<br/> Range: auto range<br/> maximum. Display: 4000 dots<br/> AC Voltage: 0~600V<br/> DC Voltage: 0~600V<br/> Alternating Current: 0~400A<br/> Capacitance: 0~4mF<br/> Resistance: 0~40MΩ<br/> Frequency: 0~400Hz<br/> Battery: 2 AAA 1.5V batteries (not included)<br/> Product size: 140*38*11mm/5.51*1.50*0.43in<br/> Item Weight: 124g / 4.37oz<br/> Package Weight: 238g / 8.40oz<br/> Package size: 22*9.2*4cm/8.66*3.62*1.57in<br/> What’s in the box<br/> 1*product </p><p>Specifications<br/> SKU: AN957IP6ZMPANNAFAMZ<br/> Model: ST180<br/> Weight (kg): 0.5<br/> Color: Black<br/> Main Material: Plastic</p>" }, // ANENG ST180 Digital Multimeter, AC/DC Clamp, Voltage Tester Black
  "cables-6": { brand: "", full: "<div><div>What is MiraScreen?Mirascreen enlarge your smartphone/tablet/pc screen and mirror to bigger screens like TV/Projector through WiFi connection without installing any application. Directly plug in to the HDMI port to use. (2018 latest version)<br/> Please Google or YouTube survey first whether your phone support or not before purchase<br/> Note: USB cable is for power supply purpose. Not to connect phone with TV.Phone is connected to TV through wireless connection.<br/> Features:- Supports TV HDMI display<br/> – Perfectly enjoy the ultimate big screen: Watch movies, play games, listen music, and karaoke together enjoying with your home HD Surround Sound speaker from your handphone- Suitable for office and college PowerPoint presentation- Support 1080p video output- Comes with an extra reset button and switching mode- Support video format: AVI / DIVX / MKV / TS / DAT / MPG / MPEG / MOV / MP4 / RM / RMVB / WMV- Support audio format: MP1 / MP2 / MP3 / WMA / OGG / ADPCM-WAV / PCM-WAV / AAC<br/> Specifications:- Plug and play without any installer apps (Latest Version 2018)- Connectors: HDMI (Connect smartphone/tablet/pc screen to TV / projector)- 1080P (Full-HD)- Supports HD Sound- Operation System : Android &amp; IOS 9 and above- Package weight: 0.099 kg- Product Size (L x W x H): 6.50 x 3.50 x 1.50 cm<br/> **For Android, just connect with screen display setting in phone****For iPhone, need house wifi for internet connection****Samsung J series and Grandprime cannot support****Cannot support for Neflix, Iflix and Astro**<br/> This portable is a special device to project you mobile phones / MID / NoteBook to another big screen devices with HDMI interface (such as, HDTV, Monitor or Projector, etc) through Wi-Fi connection, under the popular standards like Miracast, DLNA and Airplay, it can enhance your TV / Projector / Monitor which have HDMI input socket. Moreover, it  has more features such as, streaming video, web surfing, photo viewer, live camera, Internet video and more, just to enjoy excellent multi-display sharing. <p>Cast your contents (Video, Game, Audio, Picture, App, and File) in your Smart Phones / Tablet PC to another big screen devices with HDMI interface (such as HDTV, Monitor &amp; Projector, etc.) by using Miracast, DLNA, and AirPlay through a WiFi connection. Perfectly to enjoy the ultimate big screen: Watch movies, play games, create your own exclusive cinema. Allows you to enjoy the different audio-visual feast!</p><p>Supports various standards (DLNA, Airplay, Miracast) with optimum latency, it can mirror/project your smartphone’s screen to your big screen TV, HDTV, Monitor, Projector, etc with HDMI port.</p><p>Easy to use. Just plug and play. No need to download any app. Compatible with most smartphones,tablets, PC, etc with mirror screen feature.</p><p>Fully supports 1920x1080p resolution giving you pixel-to-pixel display.</p><p>System Requirements for iOS</p><p></p><ul><li>iOS 7 and above</li><li>All iPhones after iPhone 4S</li><li>All iPads after iPad 2</li><li>All iPod touch after iPod touch 4th Generation</li><li>Resolution; iPhone – 480*320*1136*640</li><li>iPad – 1024*768*2048*1536</li></ul><p>System Requirements for Android</p><p></p><ul><li>Android 4.2 and above</li><li>Resolution – WVGA*1080p</li></ul><p>How to Use;</p><p></p><ol><li>Please connect AnyCast with the micro USB port to any USB adapter (preferably, your TV USB port) to power it up.</li><li>Connect AnyCast HDMI Port to your TV, Projector, Monitor, etc HDMI port and switch screen source to the connected HDMI port</li><li>Once connected, you will see the AnyCast main menu on your TV screen</li><li>Use the botton on the dongle body to switch modes between iOS and Android depending on your phone</li><li>Drag down your phone settings and look for Airplay, Smartview, Miracsat, ChromeCast, Cast, Mirror, Multiview, etc depending on your phone model</li><li>Search for AnyCast, connect and start enjoying HD view on your TV</li></ol></div></div><section><div id=\"specifications\"></div><header><h2>Specifications</h2></header><div><article><div><h2>KEY FEATURES</h2><div><ol><li>Supports Screen Share: Airplay, Miracast, DLNA (DLNA: Standard).</li><li>Wi-Fi: 802.11b / g / n 2.4GHz Wireless WiFi 150Mbps.</li><li>(Comes with External WiFi Antenna to provide 10M WiFi Signal Coverage)</li><li>Car WiFi Display, Travel Partner: Supports Car HDMI, Wireless phone connected to the Car Display. Traffic jam time is no longer boring! Make your car instantly become intelligent car!</li><li>E-learning, business meeting: Wireless Display, from out of the shackles of cable, the meeting has become intelligent and efficient.</li></ol></div></div></article><article><div><h2>WHAT’S IN THE BOX</h2><div>1 * Anycast M2 Plus Wireless Wi-Fi Display Receiver</div></div></article><article><div><h2>SPECIFICATIONS</h2><ul><li><span>SKU</span>: MI493EA0TK63INAFAMZ</li><li><span>Model</span>: TV Dongle</li><li><span>Weight (kg)</span>: 0.1</li><li><span>Color</span>: Black</li><li><span>Main Material</span>: plastic</li><li><span>Shop Type</span>: Jumia Mall</li></ul></div></article></div></section>" }, // Anycast M2 Plus Wifi Dongle HDMI Mirror Screen Display Projector Amplifier Airplay TV Box Stick Chromecast
