  "radio-telecommunication-2": { brand: "", full: "<p>Overview:<br/> The Baofeng UV-5RA is a compact, durable, and high-performing dual-band handheld transceiver designed for professionals and enthusiasts who demand clear communication, long range, and reliability. Combining both VHF (136–174 MHz) and UHF (400–520 MHz) frequencies, it offers flexible performance suitable for a wide range of uses, from security operations, emergency response, event coordination, and outdoor adventures to amateur (ham) radio communication.</p><p>With its sleek, modern design and advanced functionality, the UV-5RA stands out as one of Baofeng’s most versatile two-way radios, providing dependable connectivity even in demanding environments.</p><p>Key Features:<br/> 🔹 Dual Band Frequency Range:</p><p>VHF: 136 – 174 MHz</p><p>UHF: 400 – 520 MHz<br/> Operate on both bands with seamless switching for superior communication flexibility.</p><p>🔹 Powerful Output:</p><p>Selectable High (5W) and Low (1W) power modes allow users to conserve battery life or extend communication range as needed.</p><p>🔹 128 Programmable Memory Channels:<br/> Store your preferred frequencies and easily recall them using the intuitive interface. Perfect for teams managing multiple channels or frequencies.</p><p>🔹 Clear Voice and Signal Quality:<br/> Advanced audio processing ensures crisp, noise-free communication, even in noisy environments — ideal for security guards, event marshals, or field workers.</p><p>🔹 Built-in Flashlight &amp; Emergency Alarm:<br/> Stay prepared during nighttime operations or emergencies. The built-in LED flashlight and alarm siren provide added safety and visibility.</p><p>🔹 CTCSS / DCS Encoding:<br/> Prevents interference and ensures secure communication by filtering unwanted transmissions.</p><p>🔹 Dual Watch / Dual Reception:<br/> Monitor two frequencies simultaneously — never miss an important call while staying connected on another channel.</p><p>🔹 VOX (Hands-Free Operation):<br/> Voice-activated transmission (VOX) enables hands-free use — convenient for tactical and professional use.</p><p>🔹 Battery Life &amp; Power:</p><p>1800mAh Li-ion rechargeable battery provides long-lasting power for extended use.</p><p>Includes a desktop charging dock for fast and convenient recharging.</p><p>🔹 Durable &amp; Portable Design:<br/> Compact and rugged construction makes it easy to carry and reliable for outdoor and professional use. The UV-5RA is engineered to withstand tough field conditions.</p><p>Technical Specifications:<br/> Specification Details<br/> Frequency Range VHF: 136–174 MHz / UHF: 400–520 MHz<br/> Channel Capacity 128 Channels<br/> Output Power 5W (High) / 1W (Low)<br/> Battery Capacity 1800 mAh Li-ion<br/> Operating Voltage DC 7.4V<br/> Frequency Step 2.5/5/6.25/10/12.5/25 kHz<br/> Antenna Impedance 50Ω<br/> Audio Output 1000mW<br/> Dimensions 110 x 58 x 32 mm (approx.)<br/> Weight ~240g (with battery and antenna)<br/> Display Dual-line LCD with backlight<br/> Standby Mode Dual Watch / Dual Reception<br/> Package Includes:<br/> 1 × Baofeng UV-5RA Transceiver</p><p>1 × 1800mAh Li-ion Battery</p><p>1 × Antenna</p><p>1 × Desktop Charging Dock</p><p>1 × Power Adapter</p><p>1 × Belt Clip</p><p>1 × Hand Strap</p><p>1 × Earpiece (optional in some packages)</p><p>1 × User Manual</p><p>Ideal For:<br/> Private Security Firms &amp; Patrol Teams</p><p>Construction &amp; Facility Management</p><p>Outdoor Adventures (Camping, Hiking, Hunting)</p><p>Event Coordination &amp; Logistics</p><p>Emergency &amp; Rescue Services</p><p>Amateur Radio Enthusiasts (HAM Operators)</p><p>Quick Highlights:<br/> ✅ Dual Band VHF/UHF Operation<br/> ✅ 5W Output Power with Long Range<br/> ✅ 128 Memory Channels<br/> ✅ Built-in Flashlight &amp; Alarm<br/> ✅ Hands-Free VOX Mode<br/> ✅ Long Battery Life<br/> ✅ Compact and Rugged Design</p>" }, // Baofeng UV-5RA Dual Band Handheld Transceiver (VHF/UHF Two-Way Radio)
