  "smart-home-and-house-automation-13": { brand: "", full: "<p>Description<br/> Unique Features</p><p>Control your lights with ease: Enjoy the convenience of being able to turn your lights on or off from anywhere at any time, with the ability to connect to the Smart Life app and also voice commands through Amazon Alexa, Google Home Assistant, and IFTTT.<br/> Schedule your lights: Set specific times for your lights to turn on and off automatically, giving you the convenience of coming home to a well-lit house or saving energy when you’re away.<br/> Remote control: Take control of your household appliances with the touch of a button, even when you’re away from home, as long as you have a network connection.<br/> Safety first: The Intelligent Switch is made of ABS flame retardant and waterproof tempered crystal touch panel, offering protection against electric shock, you can feel safe and secure while using it.<br/> Stylish design: The Alexa/Google Home Compatible UK Glass Panel Wall Switch, 1 Gang 1 Way, White/Black will give your home a modern and stylish look.<br/> Neutral wire is required.<br/> Technical Specifications</p><p>Power supply: 90V-250V AC 50/60Hz<br/> Load Power: 1000W/g<br/> Compatible Operation System: iOS/Android<br/> Wi-Fi Frequency: 1EEE802.11 b/g/n<br/> Wi-Fi Standard: Wi-Fi 2.4GHz b/g/n<br/> Working Temperature: -20°C – 70°C<br/> Wireless Consumption: &lt;0.2W<br/> Working Humidity: &lt;95%</p>" }, // DSH 1 Gang Smart WiFi Switch
