  "smart-home-and-house-automation-17": { brand: "", full: "<p>Description<br/> Unique Features</p><p>Transform your home with the ultimate in convenience and control – our innovative Water Heater and Air Conditioner switch.<br/> Connect it with Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant for voice control and take command of your home’s climate with just the sound of your voice.<br/> Set schedules to turn on and off your water heater automatically, ensuring your home is always at the perfect temperature, even when you’re not there.<br/> With a maximum load capacity of 4400W, this switch is safe to use and easy to control.<br/> The touch button is designed to be both convenient and comfortable to use, with fast response time, ensuring you’re always in control.<br/> Control your water heater and appliances remotely via the app, and share the device with your family and friends, giving them the ability to control your home’s climate as well.<br/> Manually reset the device and take control of your home’s climate whenever you want.<br/> One mobile phone can control many switches, making it the perfect addition to any smart home.<br/> Upgrade your home with our state-of-the-art Water Heater and Air Conditioner switch, and experience the ultimate in convenience and control.</p>" }, // DSH Smart WiFi AC/Water Heater Switch
  "smart-home-and-house-automation-18": { brand: "", full: "<p>Description<br/> Introducing our advanced dimmer switch – designed to enhance your lighting experience with its versatile features. This dimmer switch is compatible with most lights that have a dimming function, allowing you to easily adjust the brightness and save on electricity.</p><p>Here are some of the key features of our dimmer switch:</p><p>Load Rating: Our dimmer switch can handle a maximum power of 500W and a maximum current of 2A/250V. It can power a wide range of bulbs including LED bulbs between 5W-300W, ordinary incandescent lights, fluorescent lights, compact fluorescent lights, spot lights, and LED light bulbs with dimming function.<br/> Timing Function: With this feature, you can schedule your lights to turn on and off at specific times, helping you save on energy and extend the life of your bulbs.<br/> Voice Control: Our dimmer switch is compatible with Amazon Alexa, Google Home Assistant, and IFTTT, allowing you to control your lights with your voice.<br/> Remote Control: You can easily control your lights from anywhere using your smartphone, giving you the convenience of turning on/off your lights or adjusting the brightness from anywhere.<br/> Technical Specifications</p><p>Power supply: 90V-250V AC 50/60Hz<br/> Load Power: 300W LED, 500W Resistive Load<br/> Compatible Operation System: iOS/Android<br/> Wi-Fi Frequency: IEEE802.11 b/g/n<br/> Wi-Fi Standard: Wi-Fi 2.4GHz b/g/n<br/> Working Temperature: -20°C ~ 70°C<br/> Wireless Consumption: &lt;0.5W</p>" }, // DSH Smart WiFi Dimmer Switch
