  "alkaline-finger-batteries-1": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product details</p><p>It offers a wide range of batteries to be used in electronics, Medical devices, remotes, calculator, measuring scales, camera, games, musical instruments, fire alarm system etc that require reliable power. Duracell AA x 4 batteries are multi-purpose rechargeablie batteries with up to 100% more power (*Longevity performance compared to the Minimum Average Duration of the 2015 IEC AA Digital Camera test. Results may vary by device or usage pattern. (www.iec.ch)), ideal for reliably powering everyday devices that require a kick of additional power. Duracell Plus alkaline batteries are available in size AA</p><p>Duralock technology keeps unused Duracell batteries fresh and powered for up to 10 years in ambient storage. These batteries give you the freedom to enjoy the use of your appliances by giving you a product you can rely on. The Duracell Plus batteries are best used when you are looking for reliable, long-lasting power in your every day devices such as motorized toys, flashlights, portable games consoles, shavers, remote controls, etc.</p><p></p><p>In 1969, Duracell was part of the Apollo 11 mission and became the first battery on the moon.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>About the Company:</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>Transmed is a full-service distributor, managing and controlling the entire distribution value chain. Our services cover supply chain, logistics, distribution, sales and promotions with best in class execution.</p><p></p><p>Established in Lebanon since 1946, Transmed focused on the distribution of a very extensive range of Household and Personal Care Products from Procter &amp; Gamble ,Clorox, Berkshire Hathaway and in parallel developed the distribution of Food products starting with Mars confectionery range, and expanded it throughout the years to include McCain, Danone baby food, United Biscuits, Kellogg’s, Mondelez, Bahlsen, Perfetti, Siblou, Junior croissants, Castania kernels, Walkers biscuits as well as many other brands.</p><p></p><p>Our business operation currently spans across 10 countries &amp; 22 Markets. In Nigeria, Transmed is the sole distributor of Duracell.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>Specifications</p><p>Key Features</p><p>Superior power performance</p><p>2650mAh power output</p><p>Always Ready power</p><p>Environmentally clean</p><p>So economical and</p><p>Safes more CASH!</p><p>What’s in the box</p><p>N/A</p><p>Specifications</p><p>SKU: DU058GR1YSPYDNAFAMZ</p><p>Product Line: JAMSTHER INVESTMENT LIMITED</p><p>Model: Rechargeable AA battery</p><p>Size (L x W x H cm): N/A</p><p>Weight (kg): 0.1</p><p>Color: N/A</p><p>Main Material: N/A</p><p>NAFDAC No.: N/A</p>" }, // Duracell Rechargeable AA R6 1.2V Replacement Battery
  "games-and-consoles-3": { brand: "", full: "<div><div><p>Step into the world of football with <strong>EA SPORTS FC™ 25</strong> on PS5, featuring stunning graphics and improved gameplay mechanics powered by <strong>FC IQ</strong>. Experience a fresh take on football simulation with enhanced AI, delivering more realistic team movements and strategies. Enjoy the all-new <strong>5v5 Rush mode</strong>, which offers exciting, fast-paced small-sided gameplay in <strong>Football Ultimate Team™</strong>, <strong>Clubs</strong>, and <strong>Kick-Off</strong> modes, making it perfect for playing with friends.</p><p>Build your dream team with over <strong>19,000 players</strong> from top clubs and leagues worldwide, using <strong>real-world data</strong> to influence in-game tactics and player roles. For the first time, take control of a women’s team in an authentic <strong>Women’s Career mode</strong>, or rewrite the careers of football icons with <strong>Live Start Points</strong> in Manager and Player Career modes.</p></div></div><section><div id=\"specifications\"></div><header><h2>Specifications</h2></header><div><article><div><h2>Key Features</h2><div><ul><li>New <strong>5v5 Rush mode</strong> for exciting, small-sided matches.</li><li>Enhanced <strong>FC IQ</strong> for more strategic control and realistic player movement.</li><li><strong>19,000+ players</strong> from top clubs and leagues.</li><li><strong>Women’s Career mode</strong> available for the first time.</li><li>Supports <strong>dual PS4 and PS5</strong> play.</li><li>Optional in-game purchases with <strong>FC Points</strong> for acquiring in-game items.</li></ul><p><strong>Release Date</strong>: September 27, 2024<br/><strong>Publisher</strong>: EA Swiss Sarl<br/><strong>Platform</strong>: PS5<br/><strong>Genres</strong>: Sports</p></div></div></article><article><div><h2>What’s in the box</h2><div><ul><li>EA SPORTS FC™ 25 (PS5 Physical Disc)</li><li>Game Manual</li><li>Special Editions may include bonus in-game content or FC Points.</li></ul></div></div></article><article><div><h2>Specifications</h2><ul><li><span>SKU</span>: EA839EC67MJDQNAFAMZ</li><li><span>Product Line</span>: EA SPORTS FC™ Series</li><li><span>Model</span>: EA SPORTS FC™ 25 Standard Edition (PS5)</li><li><span>Production Country</span>: Romania</li><li><span>Size (L x W x H cm)</span>: Standard PlayStation 5 Blu-ray disc dimensions</li><li><span>Weight (kg)</span>: 0.05</li><li><span>Main Material</span>: Blu-Ray Disc</li><li><span>From the Manufacturer</span>: &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EA SPORTS FC™ 25&lt;/strong&gt; is the latest evolution in football simulation, bringing more realism, strategic depth, and ways to play than ever before. Powered by &lt;strong&gt;FC IQ&lt;/strong&gt;, this game offers tactical enhancements that mirror real-world football strategies. New modes like &lt;strong&gt;5v5 Rush&lt;/strong&gt; bring fast-paced, small-sided football into &lt;strong&gt;Ultimate Team&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Clubs&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Kick-Off&lt;/strong&gt; modes. The game also introduces the first-ever &lt;strong&gt;Women’s Career&lt;/strong&gt; experience and includes &lt;strong&gt;19,000+ players&lt;/strong&gt; across &lt;strong&gt;700+ teams&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;120+ stadiums&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring an authentic football experience.&lt;/p&gt;</li></ul></div></article></div></section>" }, // EA Sports PS5 FC 25 Fifa 25
