  "stun-gun-0": { brand: "", full: "<p>Flashlight Taser: Dual-Function Self-Defense and Illumination Tool</p><p>Stay safe and prepared with the Flashlight Taser, a versatile self-defense tool that combines a powerful flashlight with a high-voltage stun feature. Perfect for personal safety, this device provides a bright light to illuminate your surroundings and a reliable taser function to protect against potential threats, making it an essential item for personal security.</p><p>Key Features:</p><p>Dual Functionality: Combines a bright LED flashlight with a powerful stun gun, offering both illumination and self-defense in one compact device.<br/> High-Voltage Stun Capability: Delivers a strong electric shock to deter attackers, providing a reliable and non-lethal defense option.<br/> Compact and Portable: Lightweight and easy to carry, the flashlight taser fits comfortably in your hand or bag, ensuring you’re always prepared.<br/> Rechargeable Battery: Equipped with a built-in rechargeable battery, ensuring long-lasting performance and convenience.<br/> Durable Construction: Made from high-quality materials to withstand everyday use and provide long-term reliability.<br/> Applications: Ideal for personal safety, camping, hiking, and nighttime walks, the Flashlight Taser is perfect for those who want a reliable self-defense tool that is easy to carry and use.</p><p>Benefits:</p><p>Enhanced Personal Safety: Provides peace of mind with a dual-purpose design for illumination and self-defense.<br/> Ease of Use: Simple operation ensures quick access to both flashlight and taser functions in an emergency.<br/> Portable Protection: Compact design makes it easy to carry anywhere, ensuring you’re always prepared.<br/> SKU: 5487FB8/23 Category: Stun Guns Tags: compact stun gun, dual-function taser, flashlight taser, high-voltage stun gun, LED flashlight taser, non-lethal self-defense, personal safety tool, portable self-defense, rechargeable taser flashlight, safety flashlight, self-defense flashlight, stun device., stun gun flashlight, tactical flashlight taser</p>" }, // Flashlight Taser
