  "computer-accessories-51": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product details</p><p>With the Lightning to USB 3 Camera Adapter 3 in 1. it’s easy to download photos and videos from your high resolution digital camera to your iPad or iPhone with Lightning support so you can view them on the gorgeous Retina display and share them with family and friends.</p><p></p><p>After you connect the Lightning to USB Camera Adapter, your iPad or iPhone automatically opens the Photos app, which lets you choose which photos and videos to send, then organizes them into albums. When you sync iPad or iPhone to your PC or Mac, the photos and videos on your iPad or iPhone are added to your computer’s photo library.</p><p></p><p>The Lightning to USB Camera Adapter supports standard photo formats, including JPEG and RAW, along with SD and HD video formats, including H.264 and MPEG-4. Requires iOS 9.2 or later. It supports connect USB peripherals like hubs. Ethernet adapters. audio/MIDI/ interfaces and card readers for compact Flash, SD, micro SD and more.</p><p></p><p>Specifications</p><p>Key Features</p><p>Lightning to USB 3 Camera Adapter</p><p>Lightning to USB 3 Camera Adapter</p><p>Lightning to USB 3 Camera Adapter</p><p>Lightning to USB 3 Camera Adapter</p><p>What’s in the box</p><p>1 x Lightning to USB 3 Camera Adapter</p><p>Specifications</p><p>SKU: GE779EA4OY9EVNAFAMZ</p><p>Product Line: Amazing Electro Stores</p><p>Model: N/A</p><p>Weight (kg): 0.2</p><p>Color: White</p>" }, // Lightning To USB 3 Camera Adapter 3 In 1
