  "desktop-charger-0": { brand: "", full: "<p>New Age 5in1 Desktop Charger<br/> Suitable for rechargeable Li-ion battery with the capacity of 2000mAh and below<br/> Shuts down automatically when and after your battery is fully charged.<br/> Portable mini design makes it easy to pick and carry on the go<br/> High-performance power switch is installed with auto-volt (110V-220V) capability.<br/> Adjust the position of the spring slice based on the positive and negative terminals of the battery to make a good <em>contact</em>.</p>" }, // New Age Desktop Charger
