  "button-phone-10": { brand: "", full: "<p>Nokia 105_(African Edition)Discover the phone that’s built to be loved – with a molded design that’s scratch and bump resistant and available in a range of colors. An FM wireless radio lets you listen on the move, and the all-day battery life¹ will let you talk for hours.A built-in torch will ensure you never get caught in the dark, and there’s enough storage capacity for 2,000 contacts and 500 SMS. Plus, 10 preloaded games – including classic Snake – will keep you entertained.Whatever you like to listen to, an FM wireless radio will give you the freedom to tune-in to music, sport, news and broadcasts, wherever, whenever.We all love to chat with friends and family. That’s why Nokia 105_comes with a battery that lets you talk for hours, on a single charge – and when you need to recharge, there’s a handy Micro USB charger.Who said a phone was just for staying in touch? Unwind in style with 10 classic pre-loaded games, and let the fun begin.DisplaySize:1.77 inch Resolution:QQVGAConnectivityHeadphone jack:3.5 mm USB connection:Micro USB (USB 1.1)Battery &amp; chargingBattery:800 mAh,RemovableBattery life:Standby time up to 18 days/ Talk time up to 12 hoursCharging:Micro-USB (USB 1.1)Memory &amp; storageInternal storage:4 MB RAM:4 MBPlatformCPU:Unisoc 6531EOperating SystemOperating System:S30+AudioFeatures:FM Wireless Radio (Can listen with or without a headset)NetworksMax network speed:2GNetwork bands (GSM):900/1800 (EU)Sim size:2FF (Mini SIM)MaterialsBack:PolycarbonateDimensionsHeight:14.3 mm Length:115.2 mm Weight:70 g Width:49.9 mm</p>" }, // Nokia 105_(African Edition)Discover the phone that’s built to be loved – with a molded design that’s scratch and bump resistant and available in a range of colors.
