  "game-pad-5": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product details</p><p></p><p>The DualShock 4 (CUH-ZCT1 or CUH-ZCT2) is the PlayStation 4’s controller. It has several new features from DualShock 3. One new feature is a built-in two-point capacitive touch pad on the front of the controller, which can be clicked.[30]This allows the touch pad to represent multiple buttons, as demonstrated in the PS4 version of Elite Dangerous in which the four corners of the touch pad can be mapped to a separate clickable actions.[31] The controller supports motion detection via a three-axis gyroscope and three-axis accelerometer and vibration.[30] It includes a non-removable,[32] rechargeable 3.7 V, 1000 mAh lithium-ion battery, which can be charged while the system is in rest mode. It weighs 210 g (7.4 oz) and has dimensions of 162 mm × 52 mm × 98 mm (6.4 in × 2.0 in × 3.9 in).[32]</p><p></p><p>The front of the controller features a light bar containing three LEDs that, when lit in conjunction, cause the light bar to glow a variety of colors. Developed for PlayStation VR,[33] it can be used to identify players by matching the colors of the characters they control in a game, or to provide enhanced feedback or immersion by changing patterns or colors in reaction to gameplay.[34][35] An early example of this is displayed in the game Grand Theft Auto V; the light bar will flash red and blue when the player is wanted by the police, simulating the flashing lights of a police car. The light bar is also used in conjunction with the PlayStation Camera to judge the positions and movements of multiple players</p><p>Specifications</p><p>Key Features</p><p>Includes a Gaming Headset</p><p>Peer into The Soulful Glow Of The New Model DualShock 4’s Extra Lightbar</p><p>The Difference Is Clear: Grey Buttons, Extra Light Bar On The Touch Pad..</p><p>Best Triggers on any game pad way better than the older Model</p><p>More than a controller.</p><p>Its Everything Gamers Ever Wanted</p><p>Take control of a new generation of play with a redesigned DUALSHOCK 4 wireless controller</p><p>What’s in the box</p><p>1x Gamepad</p><p>1x USB Cable</p><p>Specifications</p><p>SKU: SO521EA0G347TNAFAMZ</p><p>Product Line: Every Product</p><p>Model: DUAL SHOCK 4</p><p>Size (L x W x H cm): 18x17x7</p><p>Weight (kg): 0.4</p><p>Color: Blue mixed black</p><p>Main Material: NA</p>" }, // Original PS4 Controller Wireless Game Pad – With Original Charging Cord
  "cctv-camera-10": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product details<br/> Solar Camera Solar Surveillance Camera with SolarPanel V380 4G WiFi Dual Lens 360°Camera 4MP 4K CCTV Outdoor Security Waterproof</p><p>This powerful high definition 4g pan &amp; Tilt zoomable security wireless solar powered dual lens camera has great peculiar and unique functions and features, a mega security technology of its kind. It is the real deal for all security and surveillance purposes. It can never disappoint and very easy to manage. Install the app in your mobile phone or tablet and insert a sim in the camera, that is all needed and it is done.</p><p>HIGHLIGHTS:</p><p>PHONE RECORDING:</p><p>Click the record button in the app from your phone to record and save the videos where the camera is mounted.</p><p> SD CARD RECORDING:</p><p>Insert SD cards from 4G upwards inside the card slot of the camera. This is very important because the SD card opens all the wonderful features of the device. With the SD card the device records automatically every moment of movement within the location of the camera therefore nomoment is amiss. There are two types of playback by all videos recorded.</p><p>Time playback: It automatically plays back second by second every recording as saved in the SD card when the ‘Time Playback’ button is clicked from the app in your phone it starts to play all videos nonstop as recorded.</p><p>Specifications<br/> Key Features<br/> PHONE RECORDING:</p><p>Click the record button in the app from your phone to record and save the videos where the camera is mounted.</p><p> SD CARD RECORDING:</p><p>Insert SD cards from 4G upwards inside the card slot of the camera. This is very important because the SD card opens all the wonderful features of the device. With the SD card the device records automatically every moment of movement within thelocation of the camera therefore no moment is amiss. There are two types of playback by all videos recorded.</p><p>Time playback: It automatically plays back second by second every recording as saved in the SD card when the ‘Time Playback’ button is clicked from the app in your phone it starts to play all videos nonstop as recorded.</p><p>Specifications<br/> SKU: GE779CM7HRFE1NAFAMZ<br/> Weight (kg): 0.1</p>" }, // OriginalV380 Pro 3 Lens 4g Solar Camera 5MP
