  "alkaline-finger-batteries-3": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product details</p><p>Tenergy Alkaline AA batteries deliver outstanding performance and reliability.</p><p></p><p>Major advantages of Tenergy Alkaline batteries:</p><p></p><p>Dependable and long lasting power.</p><p>Operate reliably in temperatures of -4 to 129 degrees Fahrenheit.</p><p>Batteries are date coded to ensure freshness.</p><p>Popular applications for Tenergy AA batteries:</p><p>Cameras</p><p>Flashlights</p><p>Remote Controls</p><p>Wireless mouse</p><p>Wireless keyboards</p><p>Toys</p><p>Any other device that takes 1.5V Alkaline AA batteries</p><p>Specifications:</p><p>Voltage: 1.5V</p><p>Weight: 1.2 lbs</p><p>WARNING</p><p>NON RECHARGEABLE BATTERY! CAN NOT BE CHARGED! ONE-TIME USE BATTERY.</p><p>Risk of fire. Battery can explore or leak and cause injury if installed backwards, disassembled, charged, crushed or exposed to fire or high temperature.</p><p>Do not put the battery into a charger of any kind.</p><p>Can not be used with other types of batteries together.</p><p>Specifications</p><p>Key Features</p><p>LONG LASTING POWER – With a 48-piece AA Alkaline Battery pack, Tenergy gives you the best value for batteries at an affordable cost. Long lasting and high performing, these AA Batteries will go the distance for all your electrical needs. Stock up and keep your electronic devices ready to go, never worry about dead-battery problems again.</p><p>POWER HOUSEHOLD ELECTRONICS – A performance you can count on, our batteries function as the best household AA batteries to power your electronics. Best used on everyday applications such as wireless mouse’s &amp; keyboards, clocks, flashlights, toys, remote controls, and much more!</p><p>RELIABLE PERFORMANCE – Even at temperatures as low as -4°F degrees or as high as 129°F degrees, the Tenergy alkaline AA 1.5V batteries will still operate at optimal performance. Rest assured knowing that Tenergy stands behind the performance of our batteries.</p><p>5-YEAR SHELF LIFE &amp; DATE CODED – In emergency situations you don’t want to be without energy when you need it most. Our long lasting AA battery provides up to a 5 years shelf life for trustworthy backup energy, so you’re always prepared. All our Tenergy 1.5V AA Batteries have been date coded to guarantee freshness.</p><p>SAFETY CERTIFIED – Our double A batteries have been held to the strict requirements by RoHS (Restriction of Hazardous Substances). With a certificate by SGS under the standards of IEC60086, it has passed the all encompassing battery testing from performance, dimensions and environmental factors. WARNING: These are one time use disposable batteries. Please DO NOT recharge these batteries.</p><p>Dependable and long lasting power.</p><p>Specifications</p><p>SKU: TI862EL2B4L66NAFAMZ</p><p>Product Line: DIVINE GRACE INVESTMENT</p><p>Model: R6 AA</p><p>Weight (kg): 0.1</p><p>Color: N/A</p><p>Main Material: BATTERY</p><p>Shop Type: Jumia Mall</p>" }, // Tiger Head 1.5V AA Alkaline Non-Rechargeable Batterie
