  "cables-14": { brand: "", full: "<div><div><i>SAVE EXTRA WITH THESE UNIQUE DESIGN THAT COMES WITH A PHONE HOLDER<br/></i><ul><li><b>Compatibility: </b>It is compatible with all  phone types between 2.3″ and 3.15″ excluding Samsung Notes and Pad.</li><li><b>Strength of emitting Rays: </b><i>Good!</i><b></b>It does not cause burning sensations or bring discomfort to the eyes, making it good for long live streaming events and doing makeups for professionals in the field.</li></ul><ul><li><b>Enhancer: </b>The light can be used along with phone cameras to enhance images for improved picture quality.</li></ul><p>HOW TO USE:</p><ol><li>Remove Ring light from the box.</li><li>Take Phone Clip which comes with the set and unbolt.</li><li>Put small bolt into the shinny round nob on the rod.</li><li>Take the other part and fix directly unto the shinny nob until it fits it.</li><li>Tie bolt to the nob until its set</li><li>Now clip to the table or to any comfortable position of choice.</li><li>Plug cable to your laptop, power bank or USB phone charger</li></ol></div></div><section><div id=\"specifications\"></div><header><h2>Specifications</h2></header><div><article><div><h2>KEY FEATURES</h2><div><ul><li>Multi-Functions: 2-in-1 design combines the phone holder and selfie ring light together, it is a professional tool for creating live videos/recording with smartphone or computer. Perfect extra light for make-up, live streaming, lay flat, selfie photos, filming, video recording, online teaching, dark scenery vlogging etc.</li><li>Multiple color Temperature: Touch control- white,warm yellow,warm yellow + white. It will come in handy whenever you need extra light for making up,taking photos,making videos,reading books,and live streaming!</li><li>It can rotate in 360 Degree direction</li><li>Scratch Proof Pad – It’s got a super stable pedestal clip that holds just fine on tables, chairs etc.</li><li>Perfect for bedside reading for students at night</li></ul></div></div></article><article><div><h2>WHAT’S IN THE BOX</h2><div><ul><li>Ring light</li><li>Alloy handle rotation clip</li><li>User manual</li><li>Remote</li><li>Bag</li></ul></div></div></article><article><div><h2>SPECIFICATIONS</h2><ul><li><span>SKU</span>: GE779FD2GC5UMNAFAMZ</li><li><span>Product Line</span>: mr diy store</li><li><span>Model</span>: Light</li><li><span>Production Country</span>: China</li><li><span>Weight (kg)</span>: 6</li><li><span>Certifications</span>: Eco Friendly</li><li><span>Color</span>: Black and White</li><li><span>Main Material</span>: Plastic, Iron</li><li><span>Shop Type</span>: Jumia Mall</li></ul></div></article></div></section>" }, // Unique 22” Selfie Ring Fill Led Light & Projection Stand
