  "3g-and-2g-lte-15": { brand: "", full: "<p>Product details </p><p>Olax 4G LTE CPE</p><p>This is a universal router that works with ALL networks in Nigeria including Glo that uses band 28 in some locations. Simply insert your sim and start blasting Internet at a dangerous speed.</p><p>The Olax LTE CPE is a Long Term Evolution (LTE) wireless gateway for multiple users in household or small office environments. It enables users to access the Internet.</p><p>The MF286U supports 3GPP Release 9 with LTE CAT 4. The supported service functions are as follows:</p><p>Telenet LTE CPE MF286U Technical Specifications:</p><p>Operating Frequency:</p><p>* 4G Working Band: 4G/LTE B3/B7/B8/B20/B28/B40</p><p>* 3G Working Band: B1/B8</p><p>* 4G LTE Data service up to DL 150 Mbps and UL 50 Mbps</p><p>* Wi-Fi: 802.11 b/g/n. 2.4GHz Wi-Fi 2×2 MIMO up to 300Mbps. Maximum Users:32</p><p>* External port:</p><p>One power adapter port</p><p>One LAN/WAN port (RJ45)</p><p>Four LAN Port(RJ45)</p><p>Two external LTE antenna</p><p>One SIM card slot (Nano-SIM)</p><p>* Build-in battery:5000mAh</p><p>* Support APN Management,Firewall setup, DHCP Server, DNS RELAY,NAT and WIFI Setup</p><p>* Customer management via WebUI</p><p>* AC/DC power supply: AC (input): 100V-240V 50Hz/60Hz, DC (output): 12V/1A</p><p>Our Services<br/> Category: 4G LTE Devices Tags: 4g, airtel data, lte, mtn data, UNIVERSAL</p>" }, // Universal 4G LTE Router-Olax
