  "smart-home-and-house-automation-43": { brand: "", full: "<p>Description<br/> This multifunctional device boasts a 4″ touch screen that allows you to control all of your smart devices in one convenient location. The communication protocol of the 4″ Smart switch supports WiFi, BLE, ZigBee, making it easy to connect all of your smart devices. It also serves as a Tuya ZigBee Gateway device, allowing you to control multiple devices with ease. Upgrade your home with our innovative 4″ Smart Control Panel and simplify your life.</p>" }, // Wi-Fi+Ble+Zigbee Smart Control Panel
